{"schemaVersion":1,"sourceRecord":{"schemaVersion":1,"recordId":"wikibooks-127665-r4605271","sourceId":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa","sourceTitle":"Cookbook:Four in One Pizza","sourcePageId":127665,"sourceRevision":"4605271","sourceRevisionTimestamp":"2025-12-04T00:31:27Z","sourceRevisionUser":"Kittycataclysm","sourceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/w/index.php?title=Cookbook:Four%20in%20One%20Pizza&oldid=4605271","retrievedAt":"2026-10-13T12:54:15.393Z","sourceCategories":["Category:Baked recipes","Category:Easy recipes","Category:Inexpensive recipes","Category:Main course recipes","Category:Recipes","Category:Recipes for pizza","Category:Recipes using bacon","Category:Recipes using cheddar","Category:Recipes using chicken","Category:Recipes using cooking spray","Category:Recipes using cornmeal","Category:Recipes using low-moisture mozzarella","Category:Recipes using onion","Category:Recipes using parmesan","Category:Recipes using pineapple","Category:Recipes using pizza dough","Category:Recipes using tomato"],"license":{"id":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa-4.0","name":"Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0); Wikibooks text is generally dual-licensed with GFDL unless otherwise noted","evidenceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/wiki/Wikibooks:Copyrights","policyStatus":"verified-license","pageExceptionStatus":"not-reviewed-per-page","attribution":"Attribute Wikibooks contributors by linking each version-specific source page. Indicate that structured fields are extracted and any translated or edited text is modified. Include CC BY-SA 4.0 notice/link and share adaptations under CC BY-SA 4.0 or later.","changeNoticeRequired":true,"shareAlikeRequired":true},"sourceSha256":"35494405e5467db852477aafb10d2708a08f0814d1246ff9c99116809b7e27ee","sourceWikitext":"{{recipesummary|category=American recipes|servings=16|time=40 minutes|difficulty=2}}{{recipe}} | [[Cookbook:Cuisine of the United States|American cuisine]] | [[Cookbook:Pizza|Pizza]] \n__NOTOC__\nOne [[Cookbook:Pizza|pizza]], divided into four flavor quadrants.\n \n==Ingredients==\n\n=== Base ===\n* [[Cookbook:Cooking Spray|Cooking spray]]\n* [[Cookbook:Cornmeal|Corn meal]]\n* 1 can refrigerated pizza crust\n* 2 [[Cookbook:Teaspoon|teaspoons]] [[Cookbook:Olive Oil|olive oil]]\n* ½ [[Cookbook:Cup|cup]] (2 [[Cookbook:Ounce|ounces]]) shredded [[Cookbook:Cheddar Cheese|cheddar cheese]]\n* 1½ cups (6 ounces) shredded [[Cookbook:Mozzarella Cheese|mozzarella cheese]]\n\n===Barbecue chicken pizza corner===\n\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Tablespoon|tablespoon]] [[Cookbook:Chopping|chopped]] [[Cookbook:Onion|red onion]]\n* ½ cup [[Cookbook:Barbecue Sauce|BBQ sauce]] mixed with shredded chicken\n\n===Pizza Margherita corner===\n\n* 1 tablespoon shredded (fresh) [[Cookbook:Parmesan Cheese|Parmesan cheese]]\n* 4–5 ¼-[[Cookbook:Inch|inch]] slices Roma (aka plum) [[Cookbook:Tomato|tomatoes]]\n* 1 tablespoon thin strips of [[Cookbook:Basil|fresh basil]]\n\n===Hawaiian pizza corner===\n\n* 2 tablespoons [[Cookbook:Pizza Sauce|pizza sauce]]\n* 2 slices [[Cookbook:Ham|Canadian bacon]], cut in quarters\n* ¼ cup drained [[Cookbook:Pineapple|chopped pineapple]]\n\n===Pepperoni pizza corner===\n\n* 2 tablespoons pizza sauce\n* 8–10 slices [[Cookbook:Pepperoni|pepperoni]]\n\n==Procedure==\n\n# Preheat [[Cookbook:Oven|oven]] to [[Cookbook:Oven temperatures|425°F]].\n# Spray [[Cookbook:Cookie Sheet|cookie sheet]] with cooking spray.\n# Sprinkle lightly with cornmeal, if desired.\n# Unroll pizza dough and press out on cookie sheet into a 12 x 14-inch shape.\n# [[Cookbook:Brush|Brush]] dough with olive oil.\n# [[Cookbook:Baking|Bake]] crust for 6–8 minutes.\n# Sprinkle shredded cheddar cheese over the crust in a cross shape to divide crust in fourths.\n# In each corner, spread one of the above toppings (or one of your own!).\n# Sprinkle mozzarella cheese over the top of all.\n# Bake another 10–14 minutes, until cheese is bubbly but not burned.\n# Cut each corner into 4 squares.\n\n[[Category:Inexpensive recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes using cheddar]]\n[[Category:Recipes using chicken]]\n[[Category:Recipes using onion]]\n[[Category:Recipes using pineapple]]\n[[Category:Recipes using tomato]]\n[[Category:Recipes for pizza]]\n[[Category:Baked recipes]]\n[[Category:Main course recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes using bacon]]\n[[Category:Recipes using low-moisture mozzarella]]\n[[Category:Recipes using parmesan]]\n[[Category:Recipes using cornmeal]]\n[[Category:Recipes using cooking spray]]\n[[Category:Recipes using pizza dough]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Four in One Pizza","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"Cooking spray","sourceText":"Cooking spray","amountText":"Cooking spray","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"Corn meal","sourceText":"Corn meal","amountText":"Corn meal","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-3","name":"1 can refrigerated pizza crust","sourceText":"1 can refrigerated pizza crust","amountText":"1 can refrigerated pizza crust","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-4","name":"2 teaspoons olive oil","sourceText":"2 teaspoons olive oil","amountText":"2 teaspoons olive oil","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-5","name":"½ cup (2 ounces) shredded cheddar cheese","sourceText":"½ cup (2 ounces) shredded cheddar cheese","amountText":"½ cup (2 ounces) shredded cheddar cheese","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-6","name":"1½ cups (6 ounces) shredded mozzarella cheese","sourceText":"1½ cups (6 ounces) shredded mozzarella cheese","amountText":"1½ cups (6 ounces) shredded mozzarella cheese","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-7","name":"1 tablespoon chopped red onion","sourceText":"1 tablespoon chopped red onion","amountText":"1 tablespoon chopped red onion","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"